* Toppar stream file generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*

ioformat extended

read rtf card append
* Topologies generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*
44

AUTO ANGL DIHE DRUD

! Converts cgenff atomtype to drude atom types.
! Charges are picked from cgenff stream file
! Alpha and Thole values are picked from first match of atom type in a text file containing all currently available residues.
! If it cannot find the values -1.0 and -1.3 values are assigned to the atom type.

RESI  PROA     -1.0000
GROUP
ATOM C1     CD33A         -0.271  ALPHA   -1.8119  THOLE   1.1867
ATOM C2     CD32A         -0.277  ALPHA   -1.5966  THOLE   1.1693
ATOM C3     CD2O2A         0.618  ALPHA   -1.0160  THOLE   0.8990
ATOM O1     OD2C2A         0.000  ALPHA   -0.6990  THOLE   2.3990 ! You may also consider OD2C1C  OD2C3A Equivalent Atomtypes
ATOM O2     OD2C2A         0.000  ALPHA   -0.6990  THOLE   2.3990 ! You may also consider OD2C1C  OD2C3A Equivalent Atomtypes
ATOM H1     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H2     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H3     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H4     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H5     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H6     DUMH           0.000  !dummy H
ATOM LPO11  LPDO1         -0.380
ATOM LPO12  LPDO1         -0.380
ATOM LPO21  LPDO1         -0.380
ATOM LPO22  LPDO1         -0.380

BOND C1  C2 
BOND C1  H1 
BOND C1  H2 
BOND C1  H3 
BOND C2  C3 
BOND C2  H4 
BOND C2  H5 
BOND C3  O1 
BOND C3  O2
BOND O2  H6 
BOND  LPO11  O1 
BOND  LPO12  O1 
BOND  LPO21  O2 
BOND  LPO22  O2 

LONE RELATIVE LPO11  O1  C3  C2 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE    0.00
LONE RELATIVE LPO12  O1  C3  C2 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE  180.00
LONE RELATIVE LPO21  O2  C3  C2 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE    0.00
LONE RELATIVE LPO22  O2  C3  C2 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE  180.00
END


read param card append
* Parameters generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*

! Parameters are picked from same text file containing all currently available parameters.
! Similar approach like cgenff is applied, but it is not checked for its robustness.

BONDS
!CD33A   CD32A   195.000  1.548   ! from CD325A CD325A  PENALTY  4.000
!CD32A   CD2O2A   410.000  1.360   ! from CD2R5A CD2R5A  PENALTY 19.000
OD2C2A    DUMH    536.50      0.970 ! from OD31A    HDP1A    536.50      0.970 ! MEOH, methanol 
OD2C2A   LPDO1      0.00      0.000 ! from OD2C1D   LPDO1      0.00      0.000 ! FORM

ANGLES
CD33A   CD32A   CD2O2A   22.200  116.300   ! from CD2O2A CD31A CD33A  PENALTY 49.000
CD2O2A   OD2C2A   DUMH   65.000  108.000   ! from CD2O3A   OD31A   HDP1A   65.000  108.000   ! from CD2R6A OD31A HDP1A  PENALTY  7.000

DIHEDRALS
CD33A   CD32A   CD2O2A   OD2C2A  0.200  3  0.000   ! from CD32A CD32A CD2O2A OD2C2A  PENALTY  4.000
CD2O2A   CD32A   CD33A   HDA3A   0.156  3  0.000   ! from CD2C1A CD32A CD33A HDA3A  PENALTY  4.000
!HDA3A   CD33A   CD32A   HDA2A   0.145  3  0.000   ! from HDA2A CD32A CD33A HDA3A  PENALTY 18.000
CD32A   CD2O2A   OD2C2A   DUMH    0.990  2  180.000   ! from CD2R6A CD2R6A OD31A HDP1A  PENALTY 25.000
OD2C2A   CD2O2A   OD2C2A  DUMH    1.110  2  180.000   ! from OD2C3A CD2O3A OD30D HDP1A  PENALTY 30.000

IMPROPERS


END
RETURN
